        <name>kModdableCreationFlagLogInstrumentation</name>
        <initializer>(1 &lt;&lt; 0)</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Flag to enable XS instrumentation logging over Bluetooth. When set, the Moddable XS engine will log instrumentation data (e.g. memory usage, slot/chunk/stack statistics) via app_log. Logging is only active when a Bluetooth log listener is connected; otherwise this flag has no effect. </para>
